# Drought's additional "Sacrifice a Swamp" is paid as one choice of all the Swamps it asks (CR 601.2h), and that choice may be
# given up, taking the cast or activation back (CR 601.2, 733): under Bot2's Drought, Bot1 casts Dark Ritual, pays its {B}
# with a Swamp, and cancels at the Swamp to sacrifice - the Ritual is back in hand, the Swamp untapped, no mana floating and
# both Swamps still out. The same for Drowned's "{B}: Regenerate". Then Bot1 casts the Ritual off Mox Jet and sacrifices a
# Swamp: the cancelled payments cost nothing. Each cancel is at the Swamp to sacrifice, a choice of cards that must take one
# (`! Bot1.Choose()`).
